            "\\(\\begin{aligned}&t=\\tan\\dfrac{x}{2}\\Rightarrow x=\\tan^{-1}\\dfrac{t}{2}\\\\ &\\dfrac{dx}{dt}=\\dfrac{1}{1+t^{2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\)",
